22 0 obj
<< /A 71 0 R /Alt (Distribution of QTLs mapped within rice genome against blast disease in rice. This figure shows the distribution of QTLs across the 12 rice chromosomes for blast disease, highlighting both the chromosomal locations and the positions of blast resistance genes.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 47 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 72 0 R /Alt (Future prospects for developing blast disease in rice. This figure represents the future prospects for resistance against rice blast research, such as genomic selection, genome editing, cloning and molecular characterization, bioinformatic tools, nanotechnology, and high-throughput phenotyping.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 58 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
